OL,3,GNEWSALocals 'shocked, angry and scared'
OL,4,Aby solar farm plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near the proposed site of
OL,7,Fa huge new solar farm have told the BBC
OL,8,Fthey are "shocked, angry and very
OL,9,Fscared" by the plans.
OL,11,FDeveloper Low Carbon said the 2,400
OL,12,Facre West Oxfordshire Energy Plant
OL,13,F(WOEP) would produce 500MW - enough
OL,14,Felectricity to power 145,000 homes.
OL,16,FThree of the UK's biggest solar farms
OL,17,Fare now being planned for Oxfordshire,
OL,18,Fwith the government considering the
OL,19,Fproposal for the 840MW Botley West
OL,20,Fproject, and another 500MW solar farm
OL,21,Fproposed for Wantage area.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
